<title>FINLAND: SUOMEN HELASTO 6-MTH PROFIT UP 47 PCT.</title>
<headline>SUOMEN HELASTO 6-MTH PROFIT UP 47 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		   4.1 vs 2.8</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.57 vs 0.46</p>
<p> Net sales					   58.3 vs 47.1</p>
<p> Operating profit				   4.8 vs 3.6</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	  4.1 vs 2.8</p>
<p> Taxes						  1.6 vs 0.7</p>
<p> Net profit					   2.9 vs 2.1</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    34.8 vs 38.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Suomen Helasto Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 6805 0245</p>
</text>
